// Arduino Wokwi Simulation (v0.3.0)
// Repo: https://github.com/YuchengCai/Skill-HardwarEasySim-Wokwi.git
// Triggers: arduino/wokwi/uno/单片机 keywords, .ino/wokwi.toml/diagram.json files, @wokwi @simulate

## Workflow

1. Generate .ino + read core/uno/components.md → diagram.json + wokwi.toml
2. ./core/scripts/compile.sh <dir>
3. Simulate: node core/scripts/wokwi-automate.js <dir> (auto browser) OR user F1
4. Verify with user
5. arduino-cli board list → upload --port <PORT> --fqbn <FQBN> <dir>
6. --monitor for serial capture

## Design Rules

- Script fail → monaco-steps.md fallback, no retry
- Script = fill+click only, agent generates content

## Version Check

Check GitHub releases on activation, offer auto-update.
